      "title": "判定示例",
      "board_content": "设 $S = \\{(1,0,0), (0,1,0), (0,0,1)\\}$，则 $S$ 是 $\\mathbb{R}^3$ 的基。\n\n若 $S' = \\{(1,0,0), (0,1,0), (1,1,0)\\}$，则 $S'$ 不是基，因为 $\\text{span}(S')$ 只是 $xy$ 平面，且 $ (1,1,0) = (1,0,0)+(0,1,0)$。",
      "layout": "follow",
